   "resumo_en": "Jukebox Fury is the seventh studio album by English rock band the Godfathers, released through their own Godfathers Recordings label on 4 March 2013. It is the band's first studio album since they reunited in 2008 and comes eighteen years after their previous studio album, 1995's Afterlife. It is also the first and only Godfathers studio album to feature guitarist Del Bartle.",
